OL,3,APoland accuses Russian military
OL,4,Ahelicopter of violating its airspace
OL,5,
OL,6,FPoland has said a Russian military
OL,7,Fhelicopter briefly violated its
OL,8,Fairspace, forcing the Nato member to
OL,9,Fscramble fighter jets while ground
OL,10,Fforces remained on alert.
OL,12,FIts military said the Mi-8 aircraft had
OL,13,Fcrossed from the Russian exclave of
OL,14,FKaliningrad on Wednesday morning,
OL,15,Fpenetrating Polish airspace to a depth
OL,16,Fof about 300 metres (328 yards) and
OL,17,Fstaying for 42 seconds north of
OL,18,FBraniewo.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
