OL,3,APoland accuses Russian military
OL,4,Ahelicopter of violating its airspace
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said "the nature of the incident
OL,7,Findicates that Russia is once again
OL,8,Ftesting the readiness of our air
OL,9,Fdefence". Moscow did not comment
OL,10,Fimmediately.
OL,12,FPoland and other European Nato members
OL,13,Fhave recently said Russia may be
OL,14,Fpreparing attacks to test their
OL,15,Fcommitment to supporting Ukraine -
OL,16,FMoscow denies this.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
